    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br>Build a formidable station - Expand your little outpost and build up weapons and defenses.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247820/extras/341de0046592f942cba6044ab85e3e34.poster.avif?t=1726318100\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247820/extras/341de0046592f942cba6044ab85e3e34.webm?t=1726318100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247820/extras/341de0046592f942cba6044ab85e3e34.mp4?t=1726318100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Defend your station - Encounter countless enemies and threats.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247820/extras/b5e3e557467f9da598abc04b8d10c2e1.poster.avif?t=1726318100\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247820/extras/b5e3e557467f9da598abc04b8d10c2e1.webm?t=1726318100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247820/extras/b5e3e557467f9da598abc04b8d10c2e1.mp4?t=1726318100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Unique paths - Collect perks as you defeat enemies and build a powerful arsenal.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247820/extras/92fe8c972368cd896ea99d88776bf3fa.poster.avif?t=1726318100\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247820/extras/92fe8c972368cd896ea99d88776bf3fa.webm?t=1726318100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247820/extras/92fe8c972368cd896ea99d88776bf3fa.mp4?t=1726318100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Gain unique powers - Unlock powerful upgrades.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247820/extras/60bb8d116ff4ca6c92be162687e33a66.poster.avif?t=1726318100\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247820/extras/60bb8d116ff4ca6c92be162687e33a66.webm?t=1726318100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247820/extras/60bb8d116ff4ca6c92be162687e33a66.mp4?t=1726318100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Manage resources and crew - Mine the nearby asteroids to gather resources, help nearby colonies and hire new crew members.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247820/extras/1473516b07bff254532a097e22f282b3.poster.avif?t=1726318100\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247820/extras/1473516b07bff254532a097e22f282b3.webm?t=1726318100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247820/extras/1473516b07bff254532a097e22f282b3.mp4?t=1726318100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Random encounters - Run into strange characters and events.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247820/extras/d312c64bbc722a676c0d9b06b11c9f11.poster.avif?t=1726318100\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247820/extras/d312c64bbc722a676c0d9b06b11c9f11.webm?t=1726318100\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247820/extras/d312c64bbc722a676c0d9b06b11c9f11.mp4?t=1726318100\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 170+ components upgrades<br></li><li> 130+ ships<br></li><li> 90+ unique perks<br></li><li> 40+ gadgets to unlock <br></li><li> 40+ weapons synergies<br></li><li> 7 managers<br></li><li> 2 maps</li></ul>",
